    "detailed_description": "In this game about a gas station, you are the boss. From Zero to Hero, you are responsible here for either the economic success or downfall.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou start - as it should be - with almost nothing. If you handle it skillfully, you\u2019ll end up with a fully developed gas station, complete with your own employees and plenty to keep you busy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe following areas await you:<br />\r\n - Fuel Pumps: Refuel the approaching cars and collect payments. Additionally, expand the refueling options by earning more fuel pumps.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Car Wash: Plenty of dirty cars! Once you\u2019ve created at least one car wash facility, you can serve your customers and clean their vehicles. Later on, you can even add a self-service option!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Car Repair: Fix vehicles in your own workshop, at least until you have staff for this task.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Gas Station Shop: Collect payments from customers who have refueled, order goods, stock shelves, and sell them profitably! Of course, this comes after you\u2019ve equipped your shop with a few shelves.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n - Refinery: This is where you get the raw material\u2026 but will you also get the best conditions?1",
